    `I made a contribution with respect to the year` IS TRUE
    `I elect under section 11 not to make a contribution with respect to the year` IS TRUE
    `I have applied for the return of the contribution` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 100: no application` EQUALS FALSE

-- May I make a new election under section 11 after revoking one
`cp1 seat case 101: I revoked an election` MEANS `May I make a new election under section 11 after revoking one` WITH
    `I have elected not to make a contribution for a year and have revoked that election` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 101: I revoked an election` EQUALS FALSE

-- May I make a new election under section 11 after revoking one
`cp1 seat case 102: I never revoked` MEANS `May I make a new election under section 11 after revoking one` WITH
    `I have elected not to make a contribution for a year and have revoked that election` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 102: I never revoked` EQUALS TRUE

-- In what year does my election begin to have effect
`cp1 seat case 103: approved` MEANS `In what year does my election begin to have effect` WITH
    `the Minister has approved my election` IS TRUE
    `the year in which I filed my election with the Minister` IS 2020
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 103: approved` EQUALS JUST 2020

-- In what year does my election begin to have effect
`cp1 seat case 104: not approved` MEANS `In what year does my election begin to have effect` WITH
    `the Minister has approved my election` IS FALSE
    `the year in which I filed my election with the Minister` IS 2020
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 104: not approved` EQUALS NOTHING

-- In what year does my election cease to have effect
`cp1 seat case 105: revoked in 2023` MEANS `In what year does my election cease to have effect` WITH
    `the Minister has received a revocation of my election` IS TRUE
    `the year in which the Minister received the revocation` IS 2023
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 105: revoked in 2023` EQUALS JUST 2023

-- In what year does my election cease to have effect
`cp1 seat case 106: not revoked` MEANS `In what year does my election cease to have effect` WITH
    `the Minister has received a revocation of my election` IS FALSE
    `the year in which the Minister received the revocation` IS 2023
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 106: not revoked` EQUALS NOTHING

-- What contribution rate applies to me for the year
`cp1 seat case 107: an employee in 1975` MEANS `What contribution rate applies to me for the year` WITH
    `I contribute as` IS `contributing as an employee`
    `the year I am asking about` IS 1975
    `the rate Schedule 1 sets for me for the year` IS 0.0495
#ASSERT `cp1 seat case 107: an employee in 1975` EQUALS JUST 0.018

